    {
      "id": "claim_cd5096431ffc47de91ca0df00c2b38cd",
      "statement": "save_program(p_tree jsonb) is a SECURITY INVOKER RPC that, in one transaction, atomically flips is_active for all of the user's programs with a single conditional UPDATE, upserts phase/day/slot rows with ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE, and deletes rows whose id is absent from the input tree (upsert-then-delete-missing), preserving row ids across an edit so set_log.program_slot_id continuity survives a builder save.",
